  <Chapter id="live" n="07" label="Making of · Lock screen & island" title="Design for the screen nobody opens." intro="Most of a travel day happens on the lock screen and in the Dynamic Island. We designed those surfaces on a bench: <strong>switch the flight state</strong> and watch the Live Activity and all three island sizes update together, then try the one-second glance test.">
